Package: EconCausal
Type: Package
Title: Causal Analysis for Macroeconomic Time Series (ECM-MARS, BSTS,
        Bayesian GLM-AR(1))
Version: 1.0.4
Authors@R: c(person(given = "José Mauricio", family = "Gómez Julián",
        role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "isadore.nabi@pm.me"))
Description: Implements three complementary pipelines for causal
        analysis on macroeconomic time series: (1) Error-Correction
        Models with Multivariate Adaptive Regression Splines
        (ECM-MARS), (2) Bayesian Structural Time Series (BSTS), and (3)
        Bayesian GLM with AR(1) errors validated with Leave-Future-Out
        (LFO). Heavy backends (Stan) are optional and never used in
        examples or tests.
VignetteBuilder: knitr
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
